    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Step 1 of a two-step ownership handover: the current owner nominates a\\nsuccessor. Nothing changes until the nominee calls `accept_ownership`,\\nso a fat-fingered or uncontrolled address can never brick the registry\\n\\xe2\\x80\\x94 the trust root for every campaign. Re-proposing overwrites the\\npending nominee; the owner can abort via `cancel_ownership_transfer`.",
      "name": "propose_owner",
      "inputs": [
